    "id": "agent-approval",
    "caption": "The model only requests tool calls; the app validates them, MCP servers act with the user's identity, and consequential actions wait for human approval and land in an audit log.",
    "alt": "A user gives the agent app a task. The app sends the conversation and tool schemas to the model, which returns requested tool calls. The app validates arguments and permissions, then calls tools on an MCP server that wraps the customer's order system using the user's identity. Read tools return data directly; write tools create drafts that go to a human approver before execution. Every call is written to an audit log.",
